                <zone fixed-size='115' forceUpdate='true' h='2236' id='402' type-v2='text' w='97678' x='1161' y='73862'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='16'>- 라이더 문의 현황</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>* CPD (Contact Per Delivery) : 배달건수 대비 라이더 문의건수 비율</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>* 문의건수는 콜+BROS 문의를 대상으로 함 (단, 문의유형별 비중은 BROS 문의에 한함)</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='909' id='412' type-v2='text' w='32129' x='1161' y='76279'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>CPD</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> (%, </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#c0c0c0' fontname='Apple SD Gothic Neo'>■</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> 전체 문의건수</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>)</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='909' id='414' type-v2='text' w='26742' x='50000' y='76279'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>문의유형별 비중</run>
